- Validated input parameters to prevent unexpected behavior.
- Used `zip_longest()` to handle cases where files have different lengths, ensuring that the resulting merged file has consistent line numbers.
- Used a secure method for merging log files by writing each line individually to the output file instead of concatenating strings.

